{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"日付変わっちゃった！\nってことで\n3.22\nひなちゃん誕生日おめれろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4438530/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めでたし"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4438530/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、前の前の記事のコメ数\n初めて300超えた！\nありがとうございますヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4438530/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の中田さんはオフでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、朝起きたらだるくて\n熱測ったら\n37度あった(*゜ロ゜)\n平熱35度台なんだけどね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日れいかと生駒ちゃんに\n全然風邪ひかない\nって話をしてたところなのにw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、あれだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんへの愛の熱が上がっちゃったんだなあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4438530/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいやいや！\nここ冷めるとこじゃないぞ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだはさておき\n幸いなことにオフだったから\n1日寝てたら\n平熱になったよ＼^^／\nやったね！元気なう(*´｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、せっかくのオフがああ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも体調には気をつけて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モンハンやるの？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n前記事で\n「ひとかり行こうぜ」とか言っときながら\nやったこともないし\n持ってないです←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目覚まし何個で起きれる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n1個！\nむしろ無くても起きれる←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやって友達作る？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田にも教えてくださーいっ(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケでぐるカーを歌おうと思うんだけど\nぐるカーを歌うときのポイントは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nフリコピしておいて\n踊りながら歌い、\n「彼女と○○」「誰かと○○」のところを\n友達に言ってもらうよう煽る！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとプリ撮ったことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nありますよ〜\n晒さないけどね｀・ω・´←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の寝顔は〜\nななみん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/22/4438530/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期待を裏切らないななみん(*´｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そっちこそ！(ｃ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"wwww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}